Elementwise action of substituting approximable maps into a joint map out of a product.

<!-- formalization -->

**Theorem (`substitution_toElementMap`).** Composing a joint approximable map with a pairing of two maps, then evaluating elementwise, equals the binary elementwise action of the joint map at the images of the two components.

*Proof.* Expand by the composition, pairing, and product–binary elementwise laws. ∎
